        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Duffy Jackson, Joe Cohn, Bob Mover, Nick Brignola, Freddy Cole, Buddy DeFranco, Dick Johnson, Al Grey, Carmen Leggio\n- Places: Freeport, Hempstead, Nassau County, New York, Long Island\n- Organizations: Berklee College of Music\n- Roles: Jazz drummer\n\nFacts:\n- Duffy Jackson was born on July 3, 1953, in Freeport, New York.\n- Freeport is officially The Incorporated Village of Freeport and is a village in the town of Hempstead, Nassau County, New York, on the South Shore of Long Island.\n- Duffy Jackson is an American jazz drummer.\n- Joe Cohn studied at Berklee College of Music.\n- Joe Cohn has played with Bob Mover, Nick Brignola, Freddy Cole, Buddy DeFranco, Dick Johnson, Al Grey, Carmen Leggio, and Duffy Jackson.",
